    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels so clinical when u say that. like u are just reading from a script. i do not feel like a patient, i just feel... empty. like the world is just noise and i am not actually part of it. does that even make sense? it feels like i am already gone, just waiting for my body to catch up.",
